  "confirmedNotToExistInThisCodebase": [
    "DevExpress dxDataGrid / inline columns config for line-item editing (use molecule.grid-row-template instead)",
    "dxtextbox / generic 'textbox' component type (use atom.text-input, type: entry)",
    "dxbutton / generic 'button' component type (use atom.icon-button 'icbtn' or atom.text-button 'btn')",
    "showsnackbar exec (use action.setdataset targeting the 'snackinfo' dataset)",
    "Declarative required/datatype/length validation schema (validation is action-based, see action.validatedataset)",
    "startIcon/endIcon props on btn (compose btn.chld as an array: flex div wrapping atom.icon + atom.label)",
    "Parenthesis grouping in binding expressions (operators chain left-to-right with no precedence; split into sequenced actions instead)",
    "content.template values other than 'custom' on a list node",
    "A format prop on dxnumlbl (formatting is implicit; dxnumberbox uses format:'##,###.00')"
  ],
  "criticalRules": [
    "Expressions inside ONE mergedataset/mergedatasetarray data object all evaluate against PRE-MERGE state. Derive B from A in a SEPARATE, later action — otherwise B silently reads a stale A. Single most common cause of wrong totals.",
    "nodeepprocess:true is mandatory on any setdataset whose data is itself an action list (stored formulas, customevents, dialoginfo button handlers).",
    "Inside a deferred/nodeepprocess payload there is no row context: [this.propkey] is unavailable. Park the index in a scratch dataset (dscurListIndex) or in dslist.rowindex and read it back.",
    "resolvestyles:true is required wherever a bracket expression appears in style/appendprops.style; resolveprops:true for expressions in other props. Without them the expression renders as a literal string and the control silently misbehaves.",
    "Static props go in `props`; anything containing an expression goes in `appendprops`.",
    "onFocusOut for anything that reaches the server; whenchange only for purely local maths.",
    "Every lookup's whenclick must either stage a new customevents list or clear it (data:null) — never leave it untouched.",
    "Invoke the totals formula ('[calcformula]') from EVERY mutation path, including row deletes.",
    "required:true on a control enforces nothing. Validation is action-based (action.validatedataset)."
  ]
}
